=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Ohruru} to begin this quest.
* You must return to her while under the influence of one of the following status effects:
** {p:Bane}: given by {m:Lost Souls|Lost Soul} in {z:Eldieme Necropolis}.
*** __Rewards 1,200 Gil.__
** {p:Mute}: given by {m:Eight of Cups|Eight of Cups (Monster)} in {z:Outer Horutoto Ruins} from the (F-11) entrance in {z:West Sarutabaruta}.
*** {p:Mute} is given by an {p:Additional Effect} of its weapon.
*** __Rewards 1,000 Gil.__
** {p:Plague} given by:
*** {p:Bloodsuckers|Bloodsucker} in {z:Toraimarai Canal}. Caused by an additional effect of their melee swings. Long duration debuff.
*** {m:Deathmaw Orobons|Deathmaw Orobon} in {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} (from Vile Belch, which also inflicts Silence, so if planning to use {p:Warp} to return to Ohruru quickly, either do so with an item or after using {i:Echo Drops|Echo Drops|4151};
*** {m:Devouring Mosquito} in {p:Reisenjima} - (from Infected Leech, lasts 45s, so if planning to use {p:Warp} to return to Ohruru quickly) - near likely the most viable option at level cap).
*** __Rewards 1,500 Gil.__
* Many statuses will not last long, so be sure to set your {p:Home Point} at Home Point #1 close by.
* Once you complete the quest, she will remove the status ailment from you.

=2 Notes
The title of this quest in the Japanese version is "Super Doctor O", which is a reference to the manga {p:Super Doctor K|https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Manga/SuperDoctorK}, whose main character is a genius doctor who always wears a cloak.
